                "when_value_omitted": {
                  "state": "not_applicable",
                  "reason": "This fixed flag has no operand"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "detail": "GNU coreutils 9.6: with -l or --size, print sizes using powers of 1024; M means 1048576 bytes, not 1000000. This flag accepts no numerical operand. The separate --si option uses powers of 1000."
